  "faq": {
    "titulo": "Frequently asked questions",
    "q1": {
      "p": "What is included in the free trial?",
      "r": "Up to {vagas} active roles, unlimited candidates, and full access to AI ranking. No credit card, no commitment."
    },
    "q2": {
      "p": "Do I need a credit card to start?",
      "r": "No. The {dias} day trial does not ask for a card. An email address is enough to create your account."
    },
    "q3": {
      "p": "What happens when the trial ends?",
      "r": "Your roles stop accepting new applications and the dashboard is locked until you subscribe. Nothing is deleted: pick a plan and everything comes back exactly as you left it."
    },
    "q4": {
      "p": "Can I change plans later?",
      "r": "Yes. Upgrade or downgrade at any time, and the charge is prorated."
    },
    "q5": {
      "p": "Do candidates need to create an account?",
      "r": "No. Candidates apply straight from the role link, with no signup. They upload a resume and answer your questions."
    },
    "q6": {
      "p": "Is my data safe?",
      "r": "Yes. Data is encrypted, we follow Brazilian privacy law (LGPD), and candidates can request deletion at any time."
    },
    "q7": {
      "p": "How does the AI ranking work?",
      "r": "The AI reads the resume and the answers to your screening questions, then produces a Fit Score from 0 to 100. The higher the score, the closer the candidate is to what the role asks for."
    }
  },
